    "body": "I have the same problem on Ubuntu 22.04 jammy when using `bash` as shell. But when using `zsh` it updates correctly. I use starship version 1.14.2 installed at `~/.local/bin/starship`. I've only added the `eval \"$(starship init bash)\"` line to `~/.bashrc` and configuration is irrelevant it seems, same result no matter using my own configuration or a preset.",
